{"agency_id": "kawerau-district-council", "canonical_url": "https://www.kaweraudc.govt.nz/news/he-maimai-aroha-remember-those-we-have-lost", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T05:25:09+00:00", "content": "He Maimai Aroha | Remember those we have lost\n\nSaturday, 18 April 2026Kawerau District Council wishes to acknowledge the moving messages of love, loss, and hope left in tribute to Paul and Luti.\"The memorial board records how they touched the lives of so many in our community, and how they were loved deeply in return. There are messages from family, friends, and even strangers grieving their tragic loss,\" said Her Worship the Mayor Faylene Tunui.", "content_hash": "5802ecc94f838cb877d41b86345b6c770fcc5e8b72c2a81137e77de04f3859d9", "cross_source_ids": {"source_id": "kawerau-district-council-rss-76864402"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_rss_feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "Friday, 17 April 2026 - 9:02am", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/rss/2026-07/0d1de3afbc7db7ac5092eecf.json", "record_id": "rss:0d1de3afbc7db7ac5092eecf", "source_account": "https://www.kaweraudc.govt.nz", "source_kind": "rss_feed", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.kaweraudc.govt.nz/feed/news"}
